<view class="page">
  <view class="masthead">
    <view class="masthead__date">我的</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel__row panel__row--tight">
      <view class="panel__label">每天早上收到昨日要点</view>
      <view class="panel__value" wx:if="{{quota > 0}}">已开启 {{quota}} 次</view>
      <view class="panel__value panel__value--muted" wx:else>未开启</view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel__hint">
      微信的一次性订阅消息：授权一次可收到一条推送。要连续每天收到，可以在每次收到推送后回来再点一次开启。
    </view>
    <view class="btn {{configured ? 'btn--primary' : 'btn--plain'}} panel__btn" bindtap="onSubscribe">
      {{configured ? '开启每日推送' : '配置模板 ID 后可开启'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel__row">
      <view class="panel__label">数据来源</view>
      <view class="panel__value panel__value--link" bindtap="onCopySource">央视网 · 新闻联播</view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel__row">
      <view class="panel__label">已加载期数</view>
      <view class="panel__value">{{cachedCount}} 期</view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel__row">
      <view class="panel__label">最新一期</view>
      <view class="panel__value">{{latestDate || '—'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel__row panel__row--action" bindtap="onTestSource">
      <view class="panel__label">检测数据源连接</view>
      <view class="panel__value panel__value--arrow">{{testing ? '检测中…' : '›'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="test-result {{testOk ? 'test-result--ok' : 'test-result--bad'}}"
      wx:if="{{testResult}}"
    >{{testResult}}</view>
    <view class="panel__row panel__row--action" bindtap="onClearCache">
      <view class="panel__label">清除本地缓存</view>
      <view class="panel__value panel__value--arrow">›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="about">
    <view class="about__title">关于这个工具</view>
    <view class="about__text">
      把每晚《新闻联播》的节目条目整理成一份可以直接扫读的清单，附一句大模型生成的整体概括。
      条目文字来自央视网公开的节目信息，不含评论与二次加工。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-note">v{{version}}</view>
</view>
